    "player_hint_1_en": "(B) is in R1 since the only non-carpet square she can occupy in the last row is beside a shrub, and (C)'s clue states that he's the only person beside a shrub. Cross off any squares in R1 that are beside a shrub or a car since (E) is the only person in a car. This narrows (E) to the car in R2. Cross off the rest of R2.",
    "player_hint_2_en": "(F) is in C9 per her clue, and is south of (C). The highest row for (C) to be beside a shrub is R3, this means (F) must be in R4 or lower. This narrows down (F) to R7 C9 or R8 C9 (she cannot be beside a shrub per C's clue). (D) is also on a bed either in R7 or R8. (D) and (F) occupy R7 and R8 in some order, cross out the rest of these rows.",
    "player_hint_3_en": "This isolates one chair left for (G) to occupy in the Woods. This isolates the last person to be beside the bear in R4 C4, which is also beside a shrub, so it has to be (C).",
    "player_hint_4_en": "This isolates (E). This isolates (B). This means (D) must be in R8, so (F) must be in R9 C9.",
    "player_hint_5_en": "(A) must be in C6, either R3 or R9. Cross out the rest of C6.",
    "player_hint_6_en": "This isolates (H) to the last square in the Woods. This isolates (A) to the carpet square in Tent C. This isolates (D). This isolates (V) in the last square in Tent B with (D). Dylan is the murderer!"
